#subtitle: Building relations with the other political parties of Germany.

= Inter-Party Relationships

WIP

The <span style="color: #990000;">**PNI**</span> cannot govern by itself yet, because we do not have an electoral majority. We can reach out and build additional connections with other parties, or perhaps we can stand alone.

- @islam: The <span style="color: #000000;">Masjumi</span>.
- @pki: The <span style="color: #c00000;">PKI</span>.
- @other: The minor nationalist parties.
- @nasrani: Work together with the <span style="color: #66B2FF;">Christian</span> and <span style="color: #660000;">Catholic </span>parties.
- @pni_alone: The <span style="color: #990000;">PNI</span> can stand alone for now.
- @easy_discard

@pki

- @pki_ties: -
- @soviet_ambassador: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PKI**</span> shares close ties with the <span style="color: #a00000;">**USSR**</span>. Perhaps we can use their connections to set up a <span style="color: #a00000;">Soviet</span> Embassy?
- @joint_rally: We could organize a joint rally with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PKI**</span>.
- @org: Collaborate with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PKI**</span> in social programs.

@pki_ties
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; pki_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); sidik_strength += 3

wip

@soviet_ambassador
subtitle: -1 resources
view-if: soviet_ambassador == 0
choose-if: resources >= 1 and foreign_minister_party == '<span style="color: #990000;font-weight: bold;">PNI</span>' and pki_relation >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources >= 1: Not enough resources. ?][? if pki_relation < 55: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PKI**</span> refuses to work with us. ?][? if foreign_minister_party != '<span style="color: #990000;font-weight: bold;">PNI</span>': We do not control the Foreign Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; pki_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); sidik_strength += 3; ussr_relation += 5; soviet_embassy = 1

@joint_rally
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1 and pki_relation >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources >= 1: Not enough resources. ?][? if pki_relation < 55: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**PKI**</span> refuses to work with us. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; pki_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); sidik_strength += 3

Our joint rally was succesfull, many in the crowd were swayed by our combined strength and brotherly cooperation.

